# The river shore. Painted over a water cell on each side where the next cell
# is land: a grass lip, a dark edge, a strip of sand and wet stones. The north
# bank is the tall one (seen from above, lit from the upper left) and throws
# a translucent shadow onto the water below it. The ne, nw, se and sw frames
# are small grass corners for when only the diagonal neighbour is land. An
# outer corner is two straight frames on one cell, and they agree where they
# overlap when the vertical frames paint after the horizontal ones.
sprite fx-edge-water
size 16 16
layer floor
tag fx water shore park

frame n
